WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.667
Shaft?

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.750
This the streets, son.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:13.583
We gonna solve this
the Shaft way.

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.333
-I'm looking for...
-Shaft?

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.333
-Who's asking?
-John Shaft Jr.

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:23.375
-Junior?
-Yeah.

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:27.917
I'm here for business.
I need your help for a case.

00:00:29.042 --> 00:00:31.625
I knew this day would come.

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:33.125
What's the case?

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:34.583
My best friend was murdered.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.625
We got to go handle
our business.

00:00:37.292 --> 00:00:39.042
Oh, no. See, I'm anti-gun.

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:41.250
He's running. Shoot him.
Where the guns?

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.542
Oh, I threw those
out the window.

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:45.417
You don't throw guns
out an open window!

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.708
Kids live up here!

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:49.417
If you're gonna pursue
this investigation,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.375
I'm gonna have
to babysit your ass.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:52.583
Yeah!

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.375
What are you doing?

00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:55.792
The glass didn't break!

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:56.917
Get in here, JJ!

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.417
-Pop?
-Wait. Granddad?

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.792
You think I'll let you have
all the fun without me?

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.125
Please tell me
that you did not

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:07.917
get our son involved
in your bull--

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
That's Junior's mama.
She a little bitter.

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.625
Lady Syphilis,
Madam Chlamydia,

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.292
it's lovely to meet you both.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.083
-You can't beat up a woman.
-Why not?

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:19.708
That's, like, misogynistic.

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:21.375
You the one
being misogynistic.

00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:23.000
-I ain't mention her gender.
-Okay.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.792
I'm an equal opportunity
ass-whooper.

00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:26.042
Damn!

00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:31.917
What was that?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.417
It's capoeira.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.583
Brazilian dance-fighting.

00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:39.125
I was this far
from being proud of you.

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.292
Can you dig it?

